1
00:00:04,028 --> 00:00:05,539
Let's zoom in!

2
00:00:05,903 --> 00:00:09,097
Look! A warm ball of bees!

3
00:00:09,117 --> 00:00:12,180
Wow! Some bees shake their wing muscles!

4
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:14,680
Do all butterflies stay?

5
00:00:14,741 --> 00:00:15,911
Nope!

6
00:00:15,931 --> 00:00:17,102
These monarchs fly

7
00:00:17,122 --> 00:00:20,419
all the way to Mexico!

8
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:24,303
Huddle, fly away, or hide!

9
00:00:24,477 --> 00:00:27,430
Who is hiding under here?

10
00:00:27,450 --> 00:00:29,550
One, two, three... so many!

11
00:00:29,908 --> 00:00:34,227
Some ladybugs nap together under leaves!

12
00:00:34,850 --> 00:00:37,350
Six legs? In you go!

13
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:40,040
Is it spring yet?

14
00:00:40,150 --> 00:00:41,350
Nope!

15
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:45,330
Huddle, fly away, or hide!

16
00:00:45,350 --> 00:00:47,370
Can YOU huddle like a bee?
